                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1168A00                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  INPUT FILE W41225 IS A SUBSET OF THE FULL W41225               
*                (WHICH IS A DOWNLOAD OF WDB601)                                
*                MATCH W41225 SUBSET(DCS FOR CONCERNED COUNTRY)                 
*                WITH FILE W11690.                                              
*                OUTPUT A FILE WITH ONLY PART AND COUNTRY                       
*                WHICH IS USED TO SELECT SUPERSESSIONS IN PGM W1168800 *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  CHESTER COUCH                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  NOVEMBER 2022                                                  
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W1168AD1                                                                   
%WDB601   'INB601-'                                                             
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1168AT1 FB (657 0) VIRTUAL                                                
%WDB601   'B601-'                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1168AD2                                                                   
%W11616A  'IN90-'                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W1168AD3 FB (7 0)                                                          
%W1168A     'UT-'                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*     WORKING STORAGE                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
PROGRAM-NAMN      W   6   A   VALUE 'W1168A'                                    
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB 1                           *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
                                                                                
JOB INPUT  W1168AD1                                                             
   B601-DCS-WDB601   = INB601-DCS-WDB601                                        
   PUT W1168AT1                                                                 
                                                                                
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB 2                           *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
                                                                                
JOB INPUT (W1168AT1 KEY(B601-DCS-IDLANDX2)  +                                   
           W1168AD2 KEY(IN90-IDLANDX2))                                         
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
   UT-IDARTNR        = IN90-IDARTNR                                             
   UT-IDLANDX2       = B601-DCS-IDLANDX2                                        
   PUT W1168AD3                                                                 
END-IF                                                                          
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
